{"text": "Ani's teacher gives every child a small pot with a seed in it. 'Water it a little every day and put it in the sun,' she says. At home, Ani puts the pot on the kitchen window. For a week nothing happens, and Ani feels sad. Then one morning she sees a tiny green leaf! Every day the plant grows a little taller. Ani learns an important lesson: good things need time. Now she writes the plant's height in her notebook every Sunday.", "words": [[0.48, 0.88], [0.96, 1.38], [1.5, 1.72], [1.86, 2.1], [2.2, 2.6], [2.66, 2.69], [2.78, 3.08], [3.16, 3.44], [3.54, 3.66], [3.7, 3.73], [3.84, 4.14], [4.18, 4.28], [4.34, 4.52], [4.68, 6.32], [6.36, 6.46], [6.54, 6.57], [6.62, 6.86], [7.0, 7.22], [7.3, 7.54], [7.68, 7.78], [7.84, 8.02], [8.08, 8.16], [8.2, 8.26], [8.3, 8.38], [8.48, 8.9], [9.08, 9.18], [9.28, 9.7], [11.12, 11.24], [11.36, 11.72], [12.0, 12.22], [12.34, 12.58], [12.62, 12.7], [12.76, 13.06], [13.14, 13.2], [13.22, 13.3], [13.34, 13.72], [13.8, 14.24], [15.72, 15.86], [15.9, 15.93], [16.02, 16.24], [16.38, 16.74], [16.86, 17.4], [17.54, 17.64], [17.76, 17.98], [18.08, 18.36], [18.46, 18.88], [20.3, 20.46], [20.64, 20.78], [20.84, 21.26], [21.4, 21.5], [21.62, 21.88], [21.94, 21.97], [22.08, 22.52], [22.7, 22.98], [23.08, 23.4], [24.9, 25.2], [25.28, 25.5], [25.6, 25.68], [25.76, 26.14], [26.24, 26.58], [26.64, 26.67], [26.72, 26.96], [27.06, 27.58], [29.1, 29.34], [29.46, 29.86], [29.94, 30.02], [30.06, 30.62], [30.7, 31.1], [31.42, 31.58], [31.66, 31.96], [32.02, 32.22], [32.3, 32.78], [34.22, 34.42], [34.5, 34.6], [34.66, 34.94], [34.98, 35.06], [35.1, 35.5], [35.6, 35.9], [36.02, 36.1], [36.14, 36.24], [36.34, 36.78], [36.94, 37.16], [37.3, 38.075]], "tag": "kokoro:bf_lily", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}